    "Addresses are the Modicon numbers of the manual (00001 = coil 1, 40001 = holding register 1).",
    "32-bit counters and pulse settings are low word first (the manual: counter = (40002) × 65536 + (40001)).",
    "The floats are in the module's engineering units; the manual does not give their word order (this map uses the counters' low word first).",
